{
 "_lane": "Pterya (FFX: Isaaru's Valefor, Chapter XIV; the silhouette twin of Valefor, `lane.py twin pterya --of valefor`): the same cut, bones, marks and keys as valefor.json, moved onto Pterya's own paintings (its canvases are Valefor's with 60 px more margin on every side: registration (60, 60), silhouettes equal to 0.999 at alpha 128; `_twin_shift` has each pose's). One costume across idle, attack, cast, hurt and KO (a re-colouring of Valefor's with a soft outer glow). Game case: FFX only (Pterya is an FFX enemy, chapter 14 link 2); the rig stays OFF. EXPRESSIVE KEYS (rig-expressive-2 lane, 2026-10-19): the attack and hurt keys show the HEAD, the NECK and the BODY as pieces cut from those paintings (masks in pterya-x.masks: the painting partitioned among all parts, head and neck by hand-drawn seeds, the rest by the baseline keys: autopart.py with --seeds); the body piece carries the shoulder fur and the armour the idle body cannot bend into.",
